	=09
	=09
			<div style=3D"text-align:center;"><p style=3D"text-align:center;" class=
=3D"cms-zakon-clanak"><strong>Vlasnikova prava</strong></p></div>
	=09
		<div><p style=3D"">(1) Pravo vlasni=C5=A1tva je stvarno pravo na odre=C4=
=91enoj stvari koje ovla=C5=A1=C4=87uje svoga nositelja da s tom stvari i k=
oristima od nje =C4=8Dini =C5=A1to ga je volja te da svakoga drugoga od tog=
a isklju=C4=8Di, ako to nije protivno tu=C4=91im pravima ni zakonskim ogran=
i=C4=8Denjima.</p>
<p style=3D"">(2) U granicama iz stavka 1. ovoga =C4=8Dlanka vlasnik ima, m=
e=C4=91u ostalim, pravo posjedovanja, uporabe, kori=C5=A1tenja i raspolagan=
ja svojom stvari.</p>
<p style=3D""><strong>SUDSKA PRAKSA: </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"n=
oopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D41691" class=
=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>, </stron=
g><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zako=
n.hr/cms.htm?id=3D41735" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</stro=
ng></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" =
href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D40309" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLin=
k"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank=
" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D378=
23" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>=
, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https:/=
/www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D37955" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Rje=
=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noope=
ner noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D38003" class=3D"p=
arsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a =
