><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=
=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D23969" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><=
strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a></p>
<p style=3D"text-align:center;">&nbsp;</p></div>
