			<div style=3D"text-align:center;"><p style=3D"text-align:center;" class=
=3D"cms-zakon-clanak">=C4=8Clanak 168.</p></div>
	=09
	=09
			<div style=3D"text-align:center;"><p style=3D"text-align:center;" class=
=3D"cms-zakon-clanak"><strong>Za=C5=A1tita od povrede upisom u zemlji=C5=A1=
noj knjizi</strong></p></div>
	=09
		<div><p style=3D"">Ako netko povrijedi vlasnikovo pravo vlasni=C5=A1tva n=
evaljanim upisom u zemlji=C5=A1ne knjige, vlasnik se ima pravo =C5=A1tititi=
 od toga sredstvima koja za za=C5=A1titu knji=C5=BEnih prava daju pravila z=
emlji=C5=A1noknji=C5=BEnoga prava.</p>
<p style=3D""><strong>SUDSKA PRAKSA: </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"n=
oopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D37923" class=
=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a t=
arget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/c=
ms.htm?id=3D38253" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</strong></a=
><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=
=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D26621" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><=
strong>Presuda</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"n=
oopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D22911" class=
=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a t=
arget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/c=
ms.htm?id=3D23541" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</strong></a=
><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=
=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D23627" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><=
strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" re=
l=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D24535" =
class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a></p>
<p style=3D"text-align:center;">&nbsp;</p></div>
