ng><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zak=
on.hr/cms.htm?id=3D29079" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</str=
ong></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer"=
 href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D29099" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLi=
nk"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blan=
k" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D22=
