ref=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D24449" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink=
"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a target=3D"_blank"=
 rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/cms.htm?id=3D2445=
1" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</strong></a><strong>, </str=
