=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Presuda</strong></a><strong>, </strong><a t=
arget=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noopener noreferrer" href=3D"https://www.zakon.hr/c=
ms.htm?id=3D23817" class=3D"parsedCmsBlockLink"><strong>Rje=C5=A1enje</stro=
ng></a></p></div>
